# Master photographs, kept out of git for size — 14 files, ~33 MB.
#
# They are the *source* for product-website/scripts/build-images.mjs, which
# writes the web-sized WebP derivatives into product-website/public/images.
# Those derivatives ARE committed, so the site builds and deploys without this
# directory present. It is only needed to add a new photograph or a new width.
